text.section:
Each trust company and each trust company holding company shall also pay to the Commission:

Such additional or special costs as the Commission may incur in connection with its examination;


For investigating an application for authority to establish a branch office pursuant to § 6.2-1028, a fee of $1,800;


For investigating an application to change the location of a principal office or branch office, a fee of $1,000; and


For investigating an application made pursuant to § 6.2-1023, a fee of $7,000.
